# PRIVACY FLOOR (program hard rule, no exceptions): raw Cook County Medical
# Examiner pulls contain exact addresses, lat/long, and case numbers for
# individual decedents. This repo is PUBLIC. Never commit raw ME data here,
# even under data/raw/. Only aggregated outputs (tract/ZIP/community-area
# level or coarser) may be committed, under data/clean/.
# Reproducibility instead comes from the pull script + its pinned query
# parameters + pull date, which ARE committed (scripts/ is not sensitive).
data/raw/cook_county_me*
data/raw/*medical_examiner*
data/raw/*_me_raw*

# Large statewide TIGER/Line downloads (hundreds of MB) - reproducible from
# scripts/01_pull_census_geography_population.py's pinned URLs. Only the
# Cook-County-filtered output in data/clean/ is committed.
data/raw/tiger/
